&lt;p&gt;# Comments: 1&lt;/p&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49625644</guid><pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 12:44:36 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Show HN: Buymydeadstartup.com – Sell your IP to AI labs</title><link>https://www.buymydeadstartup.com/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;I have had my fair share of failed startups, but none so recent that I could have sold our IP (code, Slack messages -- you name it) to Anthropic, OpenAI or any other AI lab or data buyer.&lt;p&gt;I know some companies are actively approached by some brokers, but most are not, because a startup often dies as a zombie (= not in a big bang, in most cases).&lt;p&gt;BuyMyDeadStartup is a bulletin board, not a marketplace. A founder posts a text description of what the company left behind, verified against a working email address and read by a person before it goes up. Buyers write to the founder directly.&lt;p&gt;Whatever they agree is between them.&lt;p&gt;I really tried to keep this as simple as possible.&lt;/p&gt;
